WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:09,810
You're not hurt, right?

2
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:12,010
I saw the corpse downstairs and the blood in the corridor

3
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:13,250
Someone comes up to trouble you

4
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:16,370
I've already taken care of the idea of the mother and son on the eighth floor trying to take advantage of my family.

5
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:17,610
Try to use a gun from now on

6
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:20,410
Don't get too close to others, you might get hurt easily, you know.

7
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:22,420
I brought you a security door

8
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,460
And cement

9
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,820
bricks and steel

10
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,380
You can seal this floor again.

11
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:29,210
My house already has a security door

12
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:32,480
I mean seal up the entire fifteenth floor.

13
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,880
Lianlang plus a door

14
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:41,360
It would be much safer if the stairs on the other side are sealed.

15
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:42,720
The door is closed on the fifteenth floor

16
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:43,720
I have no objection

17
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,160
Close of course

18
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,240
it's safer

19
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:50,100
great

20
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,060
Seal the fire door first

21
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:53,580
The elevator door is also welded shut

22
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:55,700
To save someone from knocking it from somewhere else later
